    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d363">

                <pb facs="0616" n="602" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg602"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1939/2558: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-02T12:00:00+02:00">May 2,
                            1944—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received May 2—7:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3574. This refers to Department’s 3487, May 1, 5 p.m.<anchor n="59"
                        xml:id="d363-f1"/> Foreign Office instructed British Embassy to inform you
                    that the release of the tripartite statement on satellite countries had been
                    held up at the request of the Cabinet in order that it might be given further
                    consideration. <pb facs="0617" n="603" xml:id="pg603"/> I understand that in
                    spite of previous acceptance by the Foreign Office there are certain passages in
                    the statement which the Cabinet feels should be changed. The Cabinet is
                    considering the text of the statement this afternoon and Foreign Office promises
                    to give me the suggested changes as soon as possible whereupon they will be
                    urgently telegraphed to the Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
